<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Ssangyong Motor H1 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Ssangyong Motor H1 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won, both loss)		  1,070  vs 2,008</p>
<p>    Net (both loss)			 64.17  vs 89.74</p>
<p>    Profit before tax (both loss)     60.73  vs 89.74</p>
<p>    Revenue				  712.83  vs 658.57</p>
<p>NOTE - Ssangyong Motor Co Ltd, a unit of the Ssangyong Group, is a specialised maker of comercial vehicles and four-wheel-drive utility vehicles. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
